==================== Input ====================
// A `;`-less custom-property rule block followed by another declaration is two
// separate declarations: format the inner block, add the missing `;`.
// DIVERGES from Prettier (DIVERGENCES.md "semiless-custom-property-block"),
// which keeps the whole run verbatim (postcss swallows everything past the `}`
// as an opaque prelude string until a source `;`).
:root {
  --like-a-apply-rule: {
  color:red;} /* no semi here*/
  --another-prop: blue;
}

==================== Output ====================
